  check('文件所有权登记（服务层）：上传成功即登记上传者 + 网关上报可登记成员', ownList.ok && ownList.data.items.length === 1 && ownList.data.items[0].userId === adminUserId && ownList.data.items[0].source === 'upload'
    && ownProbe.ok && !ownProbe.data.ignored,
